# Contributors who are vouched for, or denounced, by the AX maintainers.
#
# Collaborators with write access and bots are always allowed and do not need
# an entry. Everyone else must be listed here before their pull requests are
# accepted. See "First-Time Contributors" in CONTRIBUTING.md.
#
# Syntax:
#   - One GitHub handle per line, without "@", sorted alphabetically.
#   - A leading "-" denounces the user. Their issues and pull requests are
#     closed automatically.
#   - Optional text after a space following the handle is a note.
#
# Format reference: https://github.com/mitchellh/vouch
anzal1
ashishsinghbora
dqyi11
ktsoator
moezdil
mvanhorn
